# What the shared em and en dash gate (@cosyte/script-utils, `cosyte-no-emdash`) leaves out here.
# It reads every other tracked file, and every tracked file's name. One entry per line, anchored at
# the repository root; an entry that matches no tracked path is refused.

# THE CHANGELOG. Every entry above "Released before this file was generated" is written by the
# release from a changeset, and every changeset passes this gate, as a tracked file and in the pull
# request text, before it can merge. Below that heading is the frozen archive of releases before the
# changelog generator, which is never hand-edited and holds an en dash and an encoded em dash in its
# history. The shared gate excludes by exact path, not by heading, so the whole file is listed.
CHANGELOG.md
